        "fix: [taal] in 'Dit is iets wat jou aandag trek: jy doen dit graag of': By the AWS rule a comma belongs before 'of' joining 'jy doen' and 'jy wil'.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Iets wat jou aandag trek: jy doen dit graag of jy wil meer daarvan wee': By AWS 2017 a comma belongs before the first 'of' (two clauses with their own subject and verb), as proposed for the study text; the glossary text also occurs inside the study sentence, so no unique span exists, and it is probably a shared definition, so a person or writer should decide whether the definition gets the same comma.",
